 $W:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{W}^{′} & =-\\frac{1}{x+1}W \\\\ \\frac{\\text{d}W}{W} & =-\\frac{1}{x+1}\\text{d}x \\\\ \\int \\frac{\\text{d}W}{W} & =\\int -\\frac{1}{x+1}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\ \\operatorname{ln}⁡|W| & =-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+K \\\\ |W| & ={e}^{K}(x+1)^{-1} \\\\ W & =\\frac{C}{x+1}\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nwhere $C$ is a constant.\n\nNext, we use the given value $W(1)=6$ to find $C:$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W(1) & =\\frac{C}{1+1} \\\\ 6 & =\\frac{C}{2} \\\\ C & =12\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nThus, we have\n\n$$\nW(x)=\\frac{12}{x+1}.\n$$\n\nFinally, we compute $W(3):$\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}W(3) & =\\frac{12}{3+1}=3.\\end{aligned}\n$$"] ["question-0445e2f8-6c9c-5e30-8a27-7e22ee9c426c" :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/moderate] ["answer-field-c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4" :answer-field/id #uuid "c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4"] ["answer-a6c623a5-d649-5a54-8c2b-52ae41579420" :answer/id #uuid "a6c623a5-d649-5a54-8c2b-52ae41579420"] ["answer-a6c623a5-d649-5a54-8c2b-52ae41579420" :answer/type :answer.type/math] ["answer-a6c623a5-d649-5a54-8c2b-52ae41579420" :answer/value "3"] ["answer-field-c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4" :answer-field/key "field-1"] ["answer-field-c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4" :answer-field/type :answer-field.type/blank] ["answer-field-c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4" :answer-field/correct "answer-a6c623a5-d649-5a54-8c2b-52ae41579420"] ["answer-field-c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4" :answer-field/choices "answer-a6c623a5-d649-5a54-8c2b-52ae41579420"] ["question-0445e2f8-6c9c-5e30-8a27-7e22ee9c426c" :question/answer-fields "answer-field-c5aac8d3-3126-59bd-b7a3-08af8b0916d4"] [17592186217245 :knowledge-point/questions "question-0445e2f8-6c9c-5e30-8a27-7e22ee9c426c"] [17592186397617 :question/problem "$$\n{y}^{″}-4{y}^{′}+Q(x)y=0\n$$\n\nLet ${y}_{1}$ and ${y}_{2}$ be solutions to the second-order homogeneous differential equation above, where $Q(x)$ is continuous on $(-\\infty ,\\infty ).$ The Wronskian sa